\p{Current proposed scope is specified by the active decisions that name this test.}
\p{Named by: \ref{dec-kr-0015}.}
\p{\em{Lean declaration(s):} the general theorem remains unstated; partial comparison lemmas are indexed below.}

\p{\strong{Partial implementation evidence:} \ref{augmented-generating} records the checked monad algebra-lifting and essential-image lemma and its transfer through supplied monadic comparisons. The general arity-to-exactness argument is not yet proved; this does not pass or weaken the gate.}

\p{\strong{Monad-algebra reconstruction evidence:} \ref{augmented-monad-vertical} reconstructs vertical categories and functors from arbitrary generating-monad algebras, retains the horizontal graph and proves a natural equivalence recovering each existing augmented algebra's vertical category. \ref{augmented-monad-cells} adds incident cells, all primitive operations and a surjective full-boundary evaluation map preserving both identities and arbitrary substitution. The five augmented equation families for the reconstructed operations, the comparison action identification and essential surjectivity remain open; monadicity is not yet proved.}
